 lost lands, and restore your tribe\u2019s dominion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/aba70197395a2cd417f326af4695b92f.avif?t=1772705525\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/d977f9f62556d5e136cacfd2d88ff9aa.poster.avif?t=1772705525\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/d977f9f62556d5e136cacfd2d88ff9aa.webm?t=1772705525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/d977f9f62556d5e136cacfd2d88ff9aa.mp4?t=1772705525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle enemies on two fronts: Defend yourself with towers and troops against enemy waves surging through the trenches, then command heroes and warriors in RTS sieges to capture new islands and enemy strongholds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/b39d088ddb6425110bfe9e2f9300a211.avif?t=1772705525\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/29349a5f151a8559d3ffd897d939dd6c.avif?t=1772705525\" width=1000 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon your tribe's mightiest h