re warlords who challenge your defenses with unique tactics. With each run, uncover their identity, learn their patterns, and adapt your strategy to claim victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/2fccae5828cfb00ba2a4870890d19f2d.avif?t=1772705525\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/fca62b0f315dc5f6e9baa5f4a74608c6.poster.avif?t=1772705525\" width=1000 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/fca62b0f315dc5f6e9baa5f4a74608c6.webm?t=1772705525\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/fca62b0f315dc5f6e9baa5f4a74608c6.mp4?t=1772705525\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the powers of ancient runestones and unlock upgrades for towers, warriors and economy, forging new strategies with every battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781660/extras/602afab9ae616f0233f537ee6ddbb6c6.avif?t=1772705525\" width=1000 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each battle sharpens your tactics, unlocks new tools, and prepares you for greater challenges ahead. Rise stronger and stand ready to face the Empire\u2019s assault.</p>","developers":["6side Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://sha